  "description": "Details of condition 9 (construction logistics plan) submitted pursuant to planning permission (P/2024/0595) dated 06/06/2024 for the demolition of an existing shed, oil tank and part of the existing wall for a new learning hub. Erection of a new building as the volunteer base. Creation of new Fruit Garden, erection of a storage shed with hardstanding, alteration of part of the brick walls with new accesses to the Fruit Garden and Kitchen Garden. Erection of a new canopy for the Stables and its change of use to Artist Studios, installation of new signage, reconfiguration of the staff car park, and internal works to buildings including new roof insulation, heating and power.",
